See subscapes-terrain-3d.ts:71-104 and 142-163. camera-3d scales the eye and orthoSize by ss (camera-3d.ts:245-268), and the terrain spans [0, ss]. At 800 px, terrain relief is therefore half as tall relative to the tile, and strokes are half as long relative to it.

